0.2.9~testing2 (2026-10-27)
  - Refresh retained application metadata and icons without replacing the dock
    button when a desktop entry changes.

0.2.9~testing1 (2026-10-12)
  - Remove the dock's thin border and theme shadow; retain background opacity
    control and opaque icons/indicators.

0.2.8~testing1 (2026-10-12)
  - Add --reveal and a focus-preserving remote reveal action. Never start the
    dock when absent; the CLI returns without initializing GTK.
  - Validate actual pointer position while visible after remote remapping,
    preventing a stale hover flag from blocking autohide.
  - Test absent-dock CLI and running-dock reveal without changing focus.

0.2.7~testing1 (2026-10-12)
  - Use retained native X window geometry while hidden, not GTK's zero-sized
    hidden allocation, to prevent the reveal strip collapsing/recentering.
  - Verify hidden model refresh preserves trigger width and position.

0.2.6~testing1 (2026-10-12)
  - Widen edge reveal to at least 96px and deepen it to 12px (scale aware).
  - Keep the dock visible while the pointer crosses or rests in its bottom gap.
  - Re-raise hidden reveal target on window stacking/workarea changes.
  - Test bottom-edge dwell and repeated reveal/hide cycles under Openbox.

0.2.5~testing1 (2026-10-12)
  - Replace numeric window counts with theme-colored dots around each icon,
    one per running window. Active groups use larger contrasting dots.
  - Preserve background-only transparency and opaque icons/indicators.
  - Verify two-window indicator rendering in the isolated behavioral test.

0.2.4~testing1 (2026-10-12)
  - Apply opacity only to the themed background, retaining fully opaque icons,
    indicators and controls. Rename the setting to Background opacity.

0.2.3~testing1 (2026-10-12)
  - Keep About and management exclusively in slab Settings.
  - Add live persistent gap, padding, margin and opacity controls.
  - Add optional installed GTK theme override; blank resumes desktop following.
  - Add optional short hover transitions, disabled by default; no animation loop.
  - Test live spacing/opacity and theme override/reset behavior.

0.2.2~testing1 (2026-10-12)
  - Compact dock: 20px default icons, smaller spacing and overlaid window counts.
  - Remove in-dock settings controls; package a separate slab Settings launcher.
  - Persist icon size and autohide; support remote start/show, stop and pin management.
  - Follow desktop GTK theme, icon theme and dark preference live.
  - Add isolated settings, theme and remote-action regression coverage.
